      "difficulty_reason": "The authors pair a depth-sensitive probabilistic-polynomial approximation of parity formulas with a randomized layered monotone-circuit construction whose bias amplification and concentration are controlled through all depths. The complete approximation and circuit-construction arguments are retained, rather than quoting either main bound as free background. Both bounds form one approximate-majority separation object; the resulting class-separation corollaries are not extra counts.",
